sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant LLM as MCP client / LLM
    participant MCP as Hetzner MCP server
    participant HZ as Hetzner Cloud API

    User->>LLM: "Delete server web-1"
    LLM->>MCP: server_delete (id)
    MCP->>HZ: GET server (for guards and preview)
    HZ-->>MCP: server data
    MCP-->>LLM: isError, "Confirmation required. This would: delete server web-1 permanently ... Nothing was changed."
    LLM->>User: "This will permanently delete web-1. Proceed?"
    User->>LLM: "Yes"
    LLM->>MCP: server_delete (id, confirm: true)
    MCP->>HZ: DELETE server
    HZ-->>MCP: action (running)
    MCP->>HZ: poll action until it finishes (wait)
    HZ-->>MCP: action success
    MCP-->>LLM: server_id, actions[status success]
    LLM-->>User: "Server web-1 was deleted."
